  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mhembe nhaale ja feza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sulaga mhembe ibīlī ja chūūma sha feza, ja kūyūfuulwa kūlwa kūbitana bikuminge hamò a banhū ū mu ng'hambī, na kūlwa kūbamanīīkīja ūlū lyashika ī likanza lya kūsambūla ng'hambī kwandya lūgendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū jūūlījiwa būbīlī wajo, pye a banhū bakwibilinga kū būtongi wako a ha nyango gwa kwingīla ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū yūūlīla īmò yajo, batongeeji dūhū, a bataale ba ng'anda ja Baisilaeli, hū abo bakwibilinga ū kū būtongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhembe ya kūbakomiga ūlū yūūlīla, a ba ng'hambī ja kū lwande lwa Kīīya bakwandya lūgendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū yūūlīla ya kabīlī, na a ba kū ng'hambī ja kū lwande lwa Dakama bandya ū lūgendo. Būl'ikanza lya kūhaya kwandya lūgendo īkūyūfuulwa mhembe ya kūbakomiga a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlī na ng'hūmbū ja kūbakuminga pye a banhū, shiigelile jifuulwe ī mhembe, gwike jilīle kalīlīle kangī nako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni hū beene bakūbiza bafuuji baajo ī mhembe jenījo. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo shing'we hamò nī shibyalīlwe īsho shiliza kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū yūng'wigeleelwa kwilwisha būlūgū na ng'wanishi wing'we ūyo wizaga mu sī ying'we kūmudumīla, lījagi mhembe. A henaho ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akūng'wizūkwa na kūmuguna amupīje ū kū banishi bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu makanza ging'we ga būyegi, a ga shigukulu īsho muhelelilwe, hamò na ga kūyegela ng'weji mpya, īng'wigeleelilwe kūfuula mhembe a makanza ga kūfunya shitambò shing'we sha kūpemva na sha būsangī. Ū mu gīko shikūbiza shizūkījo ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wing'we. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kwīnga Sinai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa kabīlī nū ng'weji gwa kabīlī, mu lūshikū lwa makūmi abīlī ī lilunde lyūbūūka, lyīnga a h'iheema; īlo ū mu gatī yalyo līkikalaga isandīko lya būkaanīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli bīnga ū ng'witogolo lya Sinai, bandya lūgendo bajile ūko na ūko, nose ī lilunde lyūshika ng'witogolo lya Palani, lyūlembeela ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lwenūūlo lūkabiza lūgendo lwa kwandya ū kūsambūla ī ng'hambī na kwandya kūshimīza, kūlwa kūlagīlwa na SEEBA mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabità ga ng'hambī ya lūganda lwa Yuda h'ayo gūtonga ū kwandya ū lūgendo, ha sīlīlī ya lūbembeela lwabo. Ū ntongeeji wabo walī Naashoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Isakaali walī Netaneli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zuali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Zabuloni walī Eliabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Heloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a ba numba ya ng'wa Gelishomu nī ya ng'wa Melali būlīsambūla ī lipandī lya kwikala būlībūūcha bandya lūgendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a mabità ga ng'hambī ya lūganda lwa Lubeni gūbūūka gajile, nago ha sīlīlī ya lūbembeela lwabo. Ū ntongeeji wabo walī Elizuuli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shedeuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Simioni walī Shelumieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zulishadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Gadi walī Eliasafu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Deūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a ba numba ya ng'wa Kohati nabo būbūūka, būshibūūcha ī shikolo ī sheela. Gwalī gūhelilwe gīkī ī lipandī lya kwikala lyīmīīle aho bataalī ū kūshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a mabità ga ng'hambī ya lūganda lwa Efulaimu gūūbūūka gajile, nago ha sīlīlī ya lūbembeela lwabo. Ū ntongeeji wabo walī Elishama ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Manase walī Gamalieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Pedazuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Benjamini walī Abidani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Gidioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakabiza ba kūmalīīja kūbūūka ū lūgendo, baalī ba ng'hambī ya ng'wa Dani, nabo ha sīlīlī ya lūbembeela lwabo. Ū ntongeeji wabo walī Ahiezeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amishadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Asheli walī Pagieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Okilani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa ibità lya lūganda lo Nafutali walī Ahila ng'witūnja o ng'wa Enani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabità ga Baisilaeli hū gihelelaga gīko ūlū būbūūka lūgendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, ū Musa ūhooya na nkweelaye Hobabu, ng'wana Leūli, ūyo walī ise būkwi o ng'wa Musa; ūng'wīla, “Alilūūlū ī haha twabūūka kūja ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA watwisagīja alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nakūng'winha bing'we.’ Nzūgū hamò nise, tūkūja tūkakwītīle yawiza; nguno ū SEEBA wabisagīja mihayo misoga no a Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Yaya natūdūla ū nene ū kūja ū kwenūko, nalīshoka kaya kū banhū bane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Musa ūng'wīla, “Nalīkwikūmbīlīja yaya ūkūtūleka, nguno ūlīmanile ī litogolo lyenīlī, ū bebe hū ūkūbiza miso gise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wiza hamò nise, tūkūkwinha nang'ho shose shose ī shawiza īsho alatwinhe ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bīnga a ha lūgūlū lwa ng'wa SEEBA, būshimīza bajile lūgendo lwa shikū idatū. Ū mu shikū īj'idatū jenījo, ī lisandīko lya būkaanījibo ng'wa SEEBA lyalī kū būtongi wabo, kūbakoobela ipandī lya kwifuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilunde lya ng'wa SEEBA lyalī a higūlya yabo a makanza ga līīmi ūlū babūūka ū lūgendo kwīnga a ha ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ikanza ūlū lyandya lūgendo ī lisandīko, ū Musa wahayaga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
